==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''[[ethnic]] [[cleansing]]'''

# The [[mass]] [[extermination]] or [[expulsion]] of [[people]] within a certain [[area]], especially those of an undesired ethnic or [[religious]] [[group]].

